    "body": "I think we should actually go the opposite way with this and execute the version commands lazily where possible. If we make the changes in the PR then even if the version is not used in the format string we still execute the command. This is particularly a problem for the `terraform` module as the `terraform version` command takes a loooong time depending on the number of plugins (see #2084).\n\nI have opened #2111 for this. ",
